{"coverage":205,"partial":false,"day_closed":true,"window":"09:08–20:05","movers":[{"symbol":"RTNPOWER","ticker":"RTNPOWER","company":"RattanIndia Power Limited","event_type":"litigation","quantum":"Rs 170.78 cr net award to BHEL; mcap n/a","headline":"an **Arbitral Tribunal** awards a net **Rs 170.78 crore** against the company to Bharat Heavy Electricals in the Amravati Phase-II dispute, though most of BHEL's own claims were rejected","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/RTNPOWER_03102026170848_Intimation.pdf","mcap":3453.0,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/RTNPOWER_03102026170848_Intimation.pdf"},{"symbol":"GPTINFRA","ticker":"GPTINFRA","company":"GPT Infraprojects Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 149.49 cr; ~10.0% of mcap (L1/pending award)","headline":"**wholly-owned subsidiary Alcon Builders and Engineers is declared L1 (lowest bidder)** by Western Railway for a Rs 149.49 crore signalling and telecom resignalling contract across 18 Bhavnagar-division stations -- award not yet finalised","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GPTINFRA_03102026141608_GIL-_L1_intimation_031026_SGD.pdf","mcap":1531.4,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GPTINFRA_03102026141608_GIL-_L1_intimation_031026_SGD.pdf"},{"symbol":"CURRENT","ticker":"CURRENT","company":"Current Infraprojects Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 44.76 cr; ~24.4% of mcap","headline":"receives a **Letter of Award** from Jaipur Vidyut Vitran Nigam for a Rs 44.76 crore rooftop-solar EPC contract (8,000 consumers under PM-Surya Ghar) with 5+5 years of O&M","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/CURRENTINFRA_03102026170329_Updated-Announcement_New_03-10-2026.pdf","mcap":174.6,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/CURRENTINFRA_03102026170329_Updated-Announcement_New_03-10-2026.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**GPT Infraprojects** - wholly-owned subsidiary Alcon Builders and Engineers is declared **L1 (lowest bidder)** by Western Railway for a **Rs 149.49 crore** signalling/telecom resignalling contract across 18 Bhavnagar-division stations _(~10.0% of mcap; award pending)_.","**Current Infraprojects** - receives a **Letter of Award** from Jaipur Vidyut Vitran Nigam for a **Rs 44.76 crore** rooftop-solar EPC contract covering 8,000 consumers under PM-Surya Ghar _(~24.4% of mcap)_.","**Solex Energy** - secures work orders from domestic power-sector entities for N-Type TOPCON solar PV modules aggregating **Rs 75.96 crore** _(mcap n/a)_.","**Supreme Engineering** - receives a **Rs 2.84 crore** supply order from the Ministry of Defence for speciality alloy steel bars _(SME; mcap n/a)_."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Prostarm Info Systems** - receives NSE in-principle approval for a preferential issue of up to 28,98,717 convertible warrants at Rs 147 each to non-promoters (up to ~Rs 42.6 crore, our calc; issue not yet executed).","**Standard Engineering Technology** - receives in-principle approval for a preferential issue of 24,39,750 equity shares at Rs 293 each to two non-promoter investors (~Rs 71.48 crore, our calc; allotment pending receipt of consideration)."],"m_and_a":["**RNFI Services** - board approves a **Rs 12 crore** slump-sale acquisition of the SBI and Bank of Baroda business-correspondent units of Arth Rural Connect and AgroServe Global Technologies, payable up to half in cash and half via preferential equity.","**Essar Shipping** - AGM approves disinvestment of two overseas wholly-owned subsidiaries (both with negative net worth) to a group company at fair market value."],"business_updates":["**Hindustan Zinc** - reports record Q2 FY27 mined-metal production of **271 kt** (+5% YoY) and refined-metal production of **264 kt** (+7% YoY), with silver output up **20% YoY** to 173 tonnes.","**OnEMI Technology Solutions (Kissht)** - Q2 FY27 AUM grows **68.4% YoY to ~Rs 9,317 crore**, with disbursements of **Rs 4,612 crore** in the quarter, up from Rs 3,812 crore in Q1 FY27.","**SEDEMAC Mechatronics** - posts its highest-ever quarterly ECU volumes, **14.53 lakh units** sold in Q2 FY27, up **37.5% YoY**, crossing 1 million cumulative ISG+EFI ECU sales.","**MOIL** - September 2026 manganese-ore production of **1.81 lakh tonnes**, up from 1.52 lakh tonnes a year ago (~19% YoY, our calc); FY27 cumulative production at 9.61 lakh tonnes against a 25.85 lakh tonne full-year target.","**Baazar Style Retail** - H1 FY27 revenue grows **6% YoY to Rs 9,645 million** (~Rs 964.5 crore, our conversion), though Q2 revenue fell 10% YoY to Rs 4,781 million on a festive-calendar shift; store count up 13% YoY to 283.","**AU Small Finance Bank** - provisional Q2 FY27 total deposits grow **28.6% YoY to Rs 1,70,460 crore**, gross advances up **27.9% YoY to Rs 1,50,290 crore**.","**Bank of Baroda** - global business grows **17.45% YoY to Rs 32.64 trillion** as of 30-Sep, with global advances up **18.27% to Rs 15.12 trillion** and deposits up **16.75% to Rs 17.51 trillion** (provisional).","**Ujjivan Small Finance Bank** - Q2 FY27 total deposits rise **29.2% YoY to Rs 50,649 crore**, gross loan book up **32.1% YoY to Rs 45,699 crore** (provisional).","**L&T Finance** - Q2 FY27 retail disbursements estimated at **~Rs 24,000 crore** (+27% YoY), retail loan book at **~Rs 1,34,500 crore** (+29% YoY), both provisional.","**Vedanta Aluminium Metal** - posts record Q2 FY27 aluminium production of **649 kt** (+5% YoY) and alumina production of **895 kt** (+37% YoY).","**Vedanta Power** - Q2 FY27 power sales rise **26% YoY to 5,593 million units**, taking H1 sales to a record **10,817 million units** (+32% YoY).","**Vedanta Iron and Steel** - Q2 FY27 saleable steel production rises **4% YoY to 532 kt**, hot metal production up **3% YoY to 552 kt**.","**Aurobindo Pharma** - receives USFDA final approval for Perampanel Tablets (six strengths), an approved product with an estimated **US$ 67 million** market size.","**Surani Steel Tubes** - H1 FY27 sales volume of **53,631 MT**, up **446.5% YoY** from 9,815 MT, already exceeding all of FY26's volume _(SME)_.","**Sumax Engineering** - H1 FY27 revenue of **Rs 76.88 crore**, up **7.15% YoY** _(SME)_."],"distress_risk":["**RattanIndia Power** - an Arbitral Tribunal awards a net **Rs 170.78 crore** (plus interest on a partial amount) against the company to Bharat Heavy Electricals in the Amravati Phase-II dispute, though most of BHEL's own claims were rejected.","**Skipper** - the Rs 227.53 crore Odisha GST demand disclosed 1-Oct is rectified down to **Rs 40.96 crore** by the same tax authority; the company contests the demand as erroneous.","**Nectar Lifesciences** - the Punjab & Haryana High Court remands its GST dispute back to the Appellate Authority for fresh consideration, reopening a **Rs 89.32 crore** demand that authority had earlier dropped.","**Sadhav Shipping** - Jawaharlal Nehru Port Authority withdraws its 5-year debarment order after consenting at the Bombay High Court, closing the dispute (value not disclosed)."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Patel Retail** - Acuite upgrades its long-term bank-facility rating to **BBB+** (from BBB) and short-term to **A2** (from A3+); separately withdraws the rating on a Rs 116.73 crore proposed (never-drawn) facility at the company's request."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GPTINFRA_03102026141608_GIL-_L1_intimation_031026_SGD.pdf","decl